Subject: [TEST ONLY] usb: dwc2: disable gadget buffer DMA on BCM2835

XDISP-P0.1 diagnostic only. This deliberately selects the DWC2 slave/PIO
gadget path on Raspberry Pi. It is not a product fix and must not be applied
to the stock kernel.

Apply to the Debian/Raspberry Pi 6.12.47 source after the packaged patches:

  linux-6.12.47/drivers/usb/dwc2/params.c

